t un an, il se retrouve en quatri\u00e8me place.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Un autre r\u00e9sultat qui devrait en surprendre plus d\u2019un est Undertale, le jeu ind\u00e9pendant de Toby Fox qui obtient la 13e place, quelques places devant un jeu classique comme Ocarina of Time, en 17e place.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">Voici la liste compl\u00e8te des gagnants :<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">100. Persona 3<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">99. Pok\u00e9mon Platinum<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">98. Persona 4<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">97. Super Mario World<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">96. Romance of the Three Kingdoms<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">95. Mother<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">94. Fire Emblem: Genealogy of the Holy War<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">93. Persona 5 Royal<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">92. Monster Hunter 4G<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">91. Street Fighter II<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">90. Final Fantasy VIII<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">89. Super Mario Galaxy 2<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">88. The Legend of Zelda: Skyward Sword<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">87. Monster Hunter Generations Ultimate<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400\">86. Monster Hunter<\/span><\/li>\n<li